            "remediation": {
                "description": "<p><em>Enabling the Object Versioning feature for storage buckets using Google Cloud Management Console is not currently supported.</em><br/>\nRun gsutil versioning set on command (using gsutil Python tool) using the name of the Cloud Storage bucket that you want to reconfigure as identifier parameter, to add an additional layer of data protection for your objects by enabling the Object Versioning feature for the selected storage bucket:</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">gsutil versioning set on gs:<span class=\"code-comment\">//cc-logging-bucket</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>If successful, the output should return the gsutil versioning set on command request status:</p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">Enabling versioning <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> gs:<span class=\"code-comment\">//cc-logging-bucket/...</span></pre>\n</div></div>",
