            "remediation": {
                "description": "<p>To encrypt OCI Autonomous Databases with a Customer Managed Key (CMK), perform the following steps:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Login to the OCI Console.</li>\n\t<li>Type Autonomous Database into the Search box at the top of the Console.</li>\n\t<li>Click the Autonomous Database resource from the Resources submenu.</li>\n\t<li>Click Assign next to Encryption Key: Oracle managed key.</li>\n\t<li>Select a Vault from the appropriate compartment.</li>\n\t<li>Select a Master Encryption Key.</li>\n\t<li>Click Assign.</li>\n</ol>",
