            "remediation": {
                "description": "<p>Ensure that your AWS S3 buckets enforce encryption of data over the network (as it travels to and from Amazon S3) using the Secure Sockets Layer (SSL).</p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Sign in to the AWS console</li>\n\t<li>Navigate to Amazon S3 Dashboard</li>\n\t<li>Click on 'Buckets' (Left Panel)</li>\n\t<li>Choose the reported S3 bucket</li>\n\t<li>On the 'Permissions' tab, Click on 'Bucket Policy'</li>\n\t<li>Add a bucket policy that explicitly denies (Effect: Deny) all access (Action: <tt>s3:*</tt> from anybody who browses (Principal: ) to Amazon S3 objects within an Amazon S3 bucket if they are not accessed through HTTPS (aws:SecureTransport: false).<br/>\nBelow is the sample policy:</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\">{\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Sid\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"ForceSSLOnlyAccess\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Effect\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Deny\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Principal\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"*\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Action\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"s3:*\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Resource\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"arn:aws:s3:::&lt;bucket-name&gt;/*\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Condition\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Bool\"</span>: {\n            <span class=\"code-quote\">\"aws:SecureTransport\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\"</span>\n        }\n    }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
