            "description": "This feature, when enabled, revokes all public access to a bucket and its objects. \nThis action:\n\n* Overrides access granted to allUsers (including allAuthenticatedUsers) at both the bucket and object levels\n* Restricts public sharing of existing and future resources\n* Does not impact individual user permissions\n\nPublic access prevention prevents data in your organization or project from being accidentally exposed to the public. When you enforce public access prevention on a new or existing Cloud Storage resource, no one in your organization can make data public through IAM policies or ACLs.",
